      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNEAU REST (3) has a terrific record this track and trip with three wins and one placing from four starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.01) at Launceston in a Special conditions race, finishing fourth and beaten 11 lengths. Looks the one to beat with even luck. TICKING OVER (1) was in the minors two back (19.91) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. SAVE TONIGHT (2) beaten last start over the 340m at this track but finished in the minors in a respectable 19.43. In form and must include in calculations. BEDALE (6) racing over this distance brings the best out in her.",
